  "description": "The Teammachine R 01 FOUR delivers pure race performance, shaped by data, testing and competition. Developed with Red Bull Advanced Technologies, it brings elite race engineering to every rider.\nOur 01 Premium Carbon layup keeps this frameset exceptionally light and brutally efficient, with stiffness exactly where a racer needs it. Shimano’s Ultegra Di2 groupset provides reliable, precise braking and shifting with a 4iii power meter for real-time performance insight. The ICS Carbon Aero Gen 2 one-piece cockpit and CR 50 Carbon tubeless-ready wheels complete a system designed to hold speed when it matters most.\nAnd then there’s the front end. The wide-stance fork isn’t just fast – it’s unmistakable. By calming turbulence and stabilizing airflow around the wheel, it gives the Teammachine R 01 FOUR an aerodynamic advantage visible from a distance and undeniable on the road.",
